---
const items = [
  'Vende sin internet',
  '+140.000 productos cargados',
  'Stock, caja y fiados',
  'Licencias largas, sin cuotas',
];
---
<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Controlá ventas, stock y caja. Sin manual ni curso.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Vendeto es el sistema de punto de venta para kioscos, almacenes y comercios de barrio. Lo instalás en tu computadora y sigue funcionando aunque se corte internet.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/api/latest?download=1" class="btn btn-primary">Descargar gratis</a>
        <a href="#precios" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver precios</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">Para Windows · 30 días del plan Avanzado gratis · Después seguís con el plan Gratuito</p>
    </div>
    <div class="receipt-wrap">
      <figure class="receipt" aria-label="Resumen de lo que incluye Vendeto">
        <div class="receipt-inner">
          <div class="receipt-heading"><strong>VENDETO</strong><span>Ticket #0001</span></div>
          <ul class="receipt-items">
            {items.map((item, index) => (
              <li class="receipt-row" style={`--row: ${index}`}>
                <span>{item}</span>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" /></svg>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div class="receipt-total"><span>TOTAL PARA EMPEZAR</span><strong>$0,00</strong></div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 96px 0; background: var(--bg-alt); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .hero-copy h1 { margin-bottom: 24px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .hero-sub { max-width: 58ch; color: var(--text-2); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .hero-note { max-width: 60ch; color: var(--text-2); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 18px; }
  .receipt-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; min-width: 0; filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 22px var(--shadow-color)); }
  .receipt { width: min(100%, 380px); background: var(--receipt-bg); border: 1px solid var(--receipt-line); border-bottom: 0; color: var(--receipt-text); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.875rem; transform: rotate(-1.5deg); mask: conic-gradient(from 135deg at bottom, transparent 90deg, var(--receipt-text) 0) 50% 100% / 16px 9px repeat-x, linear-gradient(var(--receipt-text) 0 0) top / 100% calc(100% - 9px) no-repeat; animation: print 900ms ease-out both; }
  .receipt-inner { padding: 32px 26px 42px; }
  .receipt-heading { display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: center; gap: 4px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--receipt-line); }
  .receipt-heading strong { font-size: 1.35rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .receipt-items { list-style: none; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--receipt-line); }
  .receipt-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 7px 0; animation: row-appear 250ms ease-out both; animation-delay: calc(900ms + var(--row) * 90ms); }
  .receipt-row svg { flex: none; color: var(--receipt-ok); }
  .receipt-total { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; padding: 14px 12px; background: var(--tag); color: var(--on-tag); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .receipt-total strong { white-space: nowrap; font-size: 1rem; }
  @keyframes print { from { clip-path: inset(0 0 100%); } to { clip-path: inset(0); } }
  @keyframes row-appear { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
  @media (max-width: 899px) {
    .hero { padding: 64px 0; }
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 48px; }
    .receipt-wrap { filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 24px var(--shadow-color)); }
    .receipt { width: min(100%, 420px); transform: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .receipt, .receipt-row { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
